  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership to Accelerate SDG Localization in Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JP focuses on climate transition, targeting off-track SDGs in an upper-middle-income context by leveraging government resources and UN policy and technical assistance. It will build on the Cooperation Framework and UNCTs work at various levels while partnering with line ministries. The JP enhances awareness and capacities to advance SDG localization at provincial and city levels, involving all 77 Provincial Governors. It will focus on two cities, addressing local climate challenges with tec</narrative>
  </description>
